{"id": "math-00", "text": "Let's break it down step by step.\n\n**Step 1: April sales**  \nNatalia sold clips to 48 friends in April.  \nSo, April sales = 48 clips.\n\n**Step 2: May sales**  \nIn May, she sold half as many clips as in April.  \nHalf of 48 = \\( 48 \\div 2 = 24 \\) clips.\n\n**Step 3: Total sales**  \nTotal = April + May = \\( 48 + 24 = 72 \\).\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{72}\n\\]", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " break", " it", " down", " step", " by", " step", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "1", ":", " April", " sales", "**", "  \n", "N", "atal", "ia", " sold", " clips", " to", " ", "48", " friends", " in", " April", ".", "  \n", "So", ",", " April", " sales", " =", " ", "48", " clips", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "2", ":", " May", " sales", "**", "  \n", "In", " May", ",", " she", " sold", " half", " as", " many", " clips", " as", " in", " April", ".", "  \n", "Half", " of", " ", "48", " =", " \\(", " ", "48", " \\", "div", " ", "2", " =", " ", "24", " \\)", " clips", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "3", ":", " Total", " sales", "**", "  \n", "Total", " =", " April", " +", " May", " =", " \\(", " ", "48", " +", " ", "24", " =", " ", "72", " \\", ").\n\n", "\\[", "\n", "\\", "box", "ed", "{", "72", "}\n", "\\]"]}
{"id": "math-01", "text": "Let's go step-by-step.\n\n**Step 1: Determine hourly rate**  \nWeng earns $12 per hour.\n\n**Step 2: Convert minutes to hours**  \nShe worked 50 minutes.  \nThere are 60 minutes in an hour, so:  \n\\[\n50 \\div 60 = \\frac{5}{6} \\text{ hours}\n\\]\n\n**Step 3: Calculate earnings**  \nEarnings = hourly rate \u00d7 hours worked  \n\\[\n12 \\times \\frac{5}{6} = 10\n\\]\n\n**Step 4: Conclusion**  \nWeng earned **$10**.\n\n\\[\n", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " go", " step", "-by", "-step", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "1", ":", " Determine", " hourly", " rate", "**", "  \n", "W", "eng", " earns", " $", "12", " per", " hour", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "2", ":", " Convert", " minutes", " to", " hours", "**", "  \n", "She", " worked", " ", "50", " minutes", ".", "  \n", "There", " are", " ", "60", " minutes", " in", " an", " hour", ",", " so", ":", "  \n", "\\[", "\n", "50", " \\", "div", " ", "60", " =", " \\", "frac", "{", "5", "}{", "6", "}", " \\", "text", "{", " hours", "}\n", "\\]\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "3", ":", " Calculate", " earnings", "**", "  \n", "E", "arnings", " =", " hourly", " rate", " \u00d7", " hours", " worked", "  \n", "\\[", "\n", "12", " \\", "times", " \\", "frac", "{", "5", "}{", "6", "}", " =", " ", "10", "\n", "\\]\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "4", ":", " Conclusion", "**", "  \n", "W", "eng", " earned", " **", "$", "10", "**.\n\n", "\\[", "\n"]}
{"id": "math-02", "text": "Let's go step-by-step.\n\n**Step 1: How much does Betty have initially?**  \nThe wallet costs $100.  \nBetty has half of what she needs:  \n\\( 100 \\div 2 = 50 \\) dollars.\n\n**Step 2: Parents give her $15.**  \nNow she has:  \n\\( 50 + 15 = 65 \\) dollars.\n\n**Step 3: Grandparents give twice as much as her parents.**  \nParents gave $15, so grandparents give:  \n\\( 15 \\times 2 = 30 \\) dollars.\n\n**Step 4: Add grandparents' money", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " go", " step", "-by", "-step", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "1", ":", " How", " much", " does", " Betty", " have", " initially", "?", "**", "  \n", "The", " wallet", " costs", " $", "100", ".", "  \n", "Bet", "ty", " has", " half", " of", " what", " she", " needs", ":", "  \n", "\\(", " ", "100", " \\", "div", " ", "2", " =", " ", "50", " \\)", " dollars", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "2", ":", " Parents", " give", " her", " $", "15", ".**", "  \n", "Now", " she", " has", ":", "  \n", "\\(", " ", "50", " +", " ", "15", " =", " ", "65", " \\)", " dollars", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "3", ":", " Grand", "parents", " give", " twice", " as", " much", " as", " her", " parents", ".**", "  \n", "Parents", " gave", " $", "15", ",", " so", " grandparents", " give", ":", "  \n", "\\(", " ", "15", " \\", "times", " ", "2", " =", " ", "30", " \\)", " dollars", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "4", ":", " Add", " grandparents", "'", " money"]}
{"id": "math-03", "text": "Let's go step-by-step.\n\n**Step 1: Pages read yesterday**  \nJulie read 12 pages yesterday.\n\n**Step 2: Pages read today**  \nToday she read twice as many pages as yesterday:  \n\\( 2 \\times 12 = 24 \\) pages.\n\n**Step 3: Total pages read so far**  \n\\( 12 + 24 = 36 \\) pages.\n\n**Step 4: Remaining pages in the book**  \nThe book has 120 pages:  \n\\( 120 - 36 = 84 \\) pages remaining.\n\n**Step 5: Half of the remaining pages for tomorrow", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " go", " step", "-by", "-step", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "1", ":", " Pages", " read", " yesterday", "**", "  \n", "Julie", " read", " ", "12", " pages", " yesterday", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "2", ":", " Pages", " read", " today", "**", "  \n", "Today", " she", " read", " twice", " as", " many", " pages", " as", " yesterday", ":", "  \n", "\\(", " ", "2", " \\", "times", " ", "12", " =", " ", "24", " \\)", " pages", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "3", ":", " Total", " pages", " read", " so", " far", "**", "  \n", "\\(", " ", "12", " +", " ", "24", " =", " ", "36", " \\)", " pages", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "4", ":", " Rem", "aining", " pages", " in", " the", " book", "**", "  \n", "The", " book", " has", " ", "120", " pages", ":", "  \n", "\\(", " ", "120", " -", " ", "36", " =", " ", "84", " \\)", " pages", " remaining", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "5", ":", " Half", " of", " the", " remaining", " pages", " for", " tomorrow"]}
{"id": "math-04", "text": "Let's break this down step by step.\n\n**Step 1: Understand the problem**  \nJames writes a **3-page letter** to **2 different friends** **twice a week**.\n\nThat means each time he writes, he writes **two separate letters**, each 3 pages long.\n\n**Step 2: Pages per session**  \nIf he writes to 2 friends, each getting a 3-page letter:  \nPages per session = \\( 3 \\times 2 = 6 \\) pages.\n\n**Step 3: Sessions per week**  \nHe does this **twice a week**:  \nPages per week = \\(", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " break", " this", " down", " step", " by", " step", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "1", ":", " Understand", " the", " problem", "**", "  \n", "James", " writes", " a", " **", "3", "-page", " letter", "**", " to", " **", "2", " different", " friends", "**", " **", "tw", "ice", " a", " week", "**.\n\n", "That", " means", " each", " time", " he", " writes", ",", " he", " writes", " **", "two", " separate", " letters", "**,", " each", " ", "3", " pages", " long", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "2", ":", " Pages", " per", " session", "**", "  \n", "If", " he", " writes", " to", " ", "2", " friends", ",", " each", " getting", " a", " ", "3", "-page", " letter", ":", "  \n", "Pages", " per", " session", " =", " \\(", " ", "3", " \\", "times", " ", "2", " =", " ", "6", " \\)", " pages", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "3", ":", " Sessions", " per", " week", "**", "  \n", "He", " does", " this", " **", "tw", "ice", " a", " week", "**:", "  \n", "Pages", " per", " week", " =", " \\("]}
{"id": "math-05", "text": "Let's break it down:\n\n- **One row of 10 flowers**:  \n\\( 1 \\times 10 = 10 \\)\n\n- **Two rows of 15 flowers each**:  \n\\( 2 \\times 15 = 30 \\)\n\n- **Three rows of 8 flowers each**:  \n\\( 3 \\times 8 = 24 \\)\n\nNow add them up:\n\n\\[\n10 + 30 + 24 = 64\n\\]\n\nSo, Mark has **64 flowers** in his garden.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{64}\n\\]", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " break", " it", " down", ":\n\n", "-", " **", "One", " row", " of", " ", "10", " flowers", "**:", "  \n", "\\(", " ", "1", " \\", "times", " ", "10", " =", " ", "10", " \\", ")\n\n", "-", " **", "Two", " rows", " of", " ", "15", " flowers", " each", "**:", "  \n", "\\(", " ", "2", " \\", "times", " ", "15", " =", " ", "30", " \\", ")\n\n", "-", " **", "Three", " rows", " of", " ", "8", " flowers", " each", "**:", "  \n", "\\(", " ", "3", " \\", "times", " ", "8", " =", " ", "24", " \\", ")\n\n", "Now", " add", " them", " up", ":\n\n", "\\[", "\n", "10", " +", " ", "30", " +", " ", "24", " =", " ", "64", "\n", "\\]\n\n", "So", ",", " Mark", " has", " **", "64", " flowers", "**", " in", " his", " garden", ".\n\n", "\\[", "\n", "\\", "box", "ed", "{", "64", "}\n", "\\]"]}
{"id": "math-06", "text": "Let's go step-by-step.\n\n**Step 1: Find how much water is currently in the tank.**  \nThe tank is \\( \\frac{3}{8} \\) full, and the full capacity is 240 liters.  \n\\[\n\\frac{3}{8} \\times 240 = 90 \\text{ liters}\n\\]\n\n**Step 2: Find how much more is needed to fill the tank.**  \nFull capacity = 240 liters.  \nCurrently has = 90 liters.  \nRemaining needed:\n\\[\n240 - 90 = 150 \\text{ liters}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " go", " step", "-by", "-step", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "1", ":", " Find", " how", " much", " water", " is", " currently", " in", " the", " tank", ".**", "  \n", "The", " tank", " is", " \\(", " \\", "frac", "{", "3", "}{", "8", "}", " \\)", " full", ",", " and", " the", " full", " capacity", " is", " ", "240", " liters", ".", "  \n", "\\[", "\n", "\\frac", "{", "3", "}{", "8", "}", " \\", "times", " ", "240", " =", " ", "90", " \\", "text", "{", " liters", "}\n", "\\]\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "2", ":", " Find", " how", " much", " more", " is", " needed", " to", " fill", " the", " tank", ".**", "  \n", "Full", " capacity", " =", " ", "240", " liters", ".", "  \n", "Currently", " has", " =", " ", "90", " liters", ".", "  \n", "Rem", "aining", " needed", ":\n", "\\[", "\n", "240", " -", " ", "90", " =", " ", "150", " \\", "text", "{", " liters", "}\n", "\\]\n\n", "**", "Final", " Answer", ":", "**\n", "\\[", "\n", "\\"]}
{"id": "math-07", "text": "Let's calculate step by step.\n\n**Step 1: Distance for the first part**  \nSpeed = 60 km/h  \nTime = 2.5 hours  \nDistance = Speed \u00d7 Time = 60 \u00d7 2.5 = **150 km**\n\n**Step 2: Distance for the second part**  \nSpeed = 80 km/h  \nTime = 1.5 hours  \nDistance = 80 \u00d7 1.5 = **120 km**\n\n**Step 3: Total distance**  \n150 + 120 = **270 km**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{270 \\text{ km}}\n\\]", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " calculate", " step", " by", " step", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "1", ":", " Distance", " for", " the", " first", " part", "**", "  \n", "Speed", " =", " ", "60", " km", "/h", "  \n", "Time", " =", " ", "2", ".", "5", " hours", "  \n", "Distance", " =", " Speed", " \u00d7", " Time", " =", " ", "60", " \u00d7", " ", "2", ".", "5", " =", " **", "150", " km", "**\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "2", ":", " Distance", " for", " the", " second", " part", "**", "  \n", "Speed", " =", " ", "80", " km", "/h", "  \n", "Time", " =", " ", "1", ".", "5", " hours", "  \n", "Distance", " =", " ", "80", " \u00d7", " ", "1", ".", "5", " =", " **", "120", " km", "**\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "3", ":", " Total", " distance", "**", "  \n", "150", " +", " ", "120", " =", " **", "270", " km", "**\n\n", "\\[", "\n", "\\", "box", "ed", "{", "270", " \\", "text", "{", " km", "}}\n", "\\]"]}
{"id": "math-08", "text": "Let's go step-by-step.\n\n**Step 1: Cost of notebooks**  \nEach notebook costs $2.50, and she buys 4.  \n\\[\n4 \\times 2.50 = 10.00\n\\]  \nSo, notebooks cost $10.00.\n\n**Step 2: Cost of pens**  \nEach pen costs $1.20, and she buys 3.  \n\\[\n3 \\times 1.20 = 3.60\n\\]  \nSo, pens cost $3.60.\n\n**Step 3: Total cost**  \n\\[\n10.00 + 3.60", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " go", " step", "-by", "-step", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "1", ":", " Cost", " of", " notebooks", "**", "  \n", "Each", " notebook", " costs", " $", "2", ".", "50", ",", " and", " she", " buys", " ", "4", ".", "  \n", "\\[", "\n", "4", " \\", "times", " ", "2", ".", "50", " =", " ", "10", ".", "00", "\n", "\\]", "  \n", "So", ",", " notebooks", " cost", " $", "10", ".", "00", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "2", ":", " Cost", " of", " pens", "**", "  \n", "Each", " pen", " costs", " $", "1", ".", "20", ",", " and", " she", " buys", " ", "3", ".", "  \n", "\\[", "\n", "3", " \\", "times", " ", "1", ".", "20", " =", " ", "3", ".", "60", "\n", "\\]", "  \n", "So", ",", " pens", " cost", " $", "3", ".", "60", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "3", ":", " Total", " cost", "**", "  \n", "\\[", "\n", "10", ".", "00", " +", " ", "3", ".", "60"]}
{"id": "math-09", "text": "Let's go step-by-step.\n\n**Step 1: Find the number of defective widgets per day.**  \n3% of 1250 =  \n\\( 0.03 \\times 1250 = 37.5 \\)  \nSince we can't have half a widget, in a real factory this would average out over time, but for calculation purposes we'll keep the decimal.\n\n**Step 2: Find the number of good widgets per day.**  \nGood widgets = \\( 1250 - 37.5 = 1212.5 \\)\n\n**Step 3: Multiply by 6 days.**  \n\\( 1212", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " go", " step", "-by", "-step", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "1", ":", " Find", " the", " number", " of", " defective", " widgets", " per", " day", ".**", "  \n", "3", "%", " of", " ", "125", "0", " =", "  \n", "\\(", " ", "0", ".", "03", " \\", "times", " ", "125", "0", " =", " ", "37", ".", "5", " \\)", "  \n", "Since", " we", " can", "'t", " have", " half", " a", " widget", ",", " in", " a", " real", " factory", " this", " would", " average", " out", " over", " time", ",", " but", " for", " calculation", " purposes", " we", "'ll", " keep", " the", " decimal", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "2", ":", " Find", " the", " number", " of", " good", " widgets", " per", " day", ".**", "  \n", "Good", " widgets", " =", " \\(", " ", "125", "0", " -", " ", "37", ".", "5", " =", " ", "121", "2", ".", "5", " \\", ")\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "3", ":", " Multiply", " by", " ", "6", " days", ".**", "  \n", "\\(", " ", "121", "2"]}
{"id": "math-10", "text": "Let's define the variables:\n\n- Let Tom's sister's age be \\( x \\).\n- Tom's age is \\( 3x \\).\n\nIn 5 years:\n\n- Sister's age will be \\( x + 5 \\).\n- Tom's age will be \\( 3x + 5 \\).\n\nThe sum of their ages in 5 years is 34:\n\n\\[\n(x + 5) + (3x + 5) = 34\n\\]\n\nSimplify:\n\n\\[\n4x + 10 = 34\n\\]\n\n\\[\n4x = 24\n\\]\n\n\\[\nx = 6\n\\]\n\nSo Tom", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " define", " the", " variables", ":\n\n", "-", " Let", " Tom", "'s", " sister", "'s", " age", " be", " \\(", " x", " \\", ").\n", "-", " Tom", "'s", " age", " is", " \\(", " ", "3", "x", " \\", ").\n\n", "In", " ", "5", " years", ":\n\n", "-", " Sister", "'s", " age", " will", " be", " \\(", " x", " +", " ", "5", " \\", ").\n", "-", " Tom", "'s", " age", " will", " be", " \\(", " ", "3", "x", " +", " ", "5", " \\", ").\n\n", "The", " sum", " of", " their", " ages", " in", " ", "5", " years", " is", " ", "34", ":\n\n", "\\[", "\n", "(x", " +", " ", "5", ")", " +", " (", "3", "x", " +", " ", "5", ")", " =", " ", "34", "\n", "\\]\n\n", "Simplify", ":\n\n", "\\[", "\n", "4", "x", " +", " ", "10", " =", " ", "34", "\n", "\\]\n\n", "\\[", "\n", "4", "x", " =", " ", "24", "\n", "\\]\n\n", "\\[", "\n", "x", " =", " ", "6", "\n", "\\]\n\n", "So", " Tom"]}
{"id": "math-11", "text": "Let's go step-by-step.\n\n---\n\n**Step 1: Understand the problem**  \nWe have a rectangular garden:  \n- Length = 12 m  \n- Width = 8 m  \n\nA path 1 m wide runs **around the outside** of the garden.  \nWe need the **area of the path only**.\n\n---\n\n**Step 2: Dimensions of the garden including the path**  \nSince the path is 1 m wide on all sides, it adds 1 m to each side:\n\n- New length = \\( 12 + 1 + 1 = 14 \\) m  \n- New width = \\( 8", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " go", " step", "-by", "-step", ".\n\n", "---\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "1", ":", " Understand", " the", " problem", "**", "  \n", "We", " have", " a", " rectangular", " garden", ":", "  \n", "-", " Length", " =", " ", "12", " m", "  \n", "-", " Width", " =", " ", "8", " m", "  \n\n", "A", " path", " ", "1", " m", " wide", " runs", " **", "around", " the", " outside", "**", " of", " the", " garden", ".", "  \n", "We", " need", " the", " **", "area", " of", " the", " path", " only", "**.\n\n", "---\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "2", ":", " Dimensions", " of", " the", " garden", " including", " the", " path", "**", "  \n", "Since", " the", " path", " is", " ", "1", " m", " wide", " on", " all", " sides", ",", " it", " adds", " ", "1", " m", " to", " each", " side", ":\n\n", "-", " New", " length", " =", " \\(", " ", "12", " +", " ", "1", " +", " ", "1", " =", " ", "14", " \\)", " m", "  \n", "-", " New", " width", " =", " \\(", " ", "8"]}
{"id": "math-12", "text": "Let's solve it step-by-step.\n\n**Step 1: Find the flour per cookie**  \nWe know 2.5 cups are for 12 cookies.  \nFlour per cookie = \\( \\frac{2.5}{12} \\) cups.\n\n**Step 2: Multiply by 30 cookies**  \nFlour for 30 cookies = \\( \\frac{2.5}{12} \\times 30 \\).\n\n**Step 3: Simplify**  \n\\( \\frac{2.5}{12} \\times 30 = \\frac{2.5 \\times 30}{12} = \\frac{75", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " solve", " it", " step", "-by", "-step", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "1", ":", " Find", " the", " flour", " per", " cookie", "**", "  \n", "We", " know", " ", "2", ".", "5", " cups", " are", " for", " ", "12", " cookies", ".", "  \n", "Fl", "our", " per", " cookie", " =", " \\(", " \\", "frac", "{", "2", ".", "5", "}{", "12", "}", " \\)", " cups", ".\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "2", ":", " Multiply", " by", " ", "30", " cookies", "**", "  \n", "Fl", "our", " for", " ", "30", " cookies", " =", " \\(", " \\", "frac", "{", "2", ".", "5", "}{", "12", "}", " \\", "times", " ", "30", " \\", ").\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "3", ":", " Simplify", "**", "  \n", "\\(", " \\", "frac", "{", "2", ".", "5", "}{", "12", "}", " \\", "times", " ", "30", " =", " \\", "frac", "{", "2", ".", "5", " \\", "times", " ", "30", "}{", "12", "}", " =", " \\", "frac", "{", "75"]}
{"id": "math-13", "text": "Let's go step-by-step.\n\n1. **First discount: 25% off $80**  \n   Discount amount = \\( 25\\% \\times 80 = 0.25 \\times 80 = 20 \\)  \n   Price after first discount = \\( 80 - 20 = 60 \\)\n\n2. **Second discount: 10% off $60**  \n   Discount amount = \\( 10\\% \\times 60 = 0.10 \\times 60 = 6 \\)  \n   Price after second discount = \\( 60 - 6 = 54 \\)\n\n**Final price:**  \n\\[\n", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " go", " step", "-by", "-step", ".\n\n", "1", ".", " **", "First", " discount", ":", " ", "25", "%", " off", " $", "80", "**", "  \n", "  ", " Discount", " amount", " =", " \\(", " ", "25", "\\%", " \\", "times", " ", "80", " =", " ", "0", ".", "25", " \\", "times", " ", "80", " =", " ", "20", " \\)", "  \n", "  ", " Price", " after", " first", " discount", " =", " \\(", " ", "80", " -", " ", "20", " =", " ", "60", " \\", ")\n\n", "2", ".", " **", "Second", " discount", ":", " ", "10", "%", " off", " $", "60", "**", "  \n", "  ", " Discount", " amount", " =", " \\(", " ", "10", "\\%", " \\", "times", " ", "60", " =", " ", "0", ".", "10", " \\", "times", " ", "60", " =", " ", "6", " \\)", "  \n", "  ", " Price", " after", " second", " discount", " =", " \\(", " ", "60", " -", " ", "6", " =", " ", "54", " \\", ")\n\n", "**", "Final", " price", ":**", "  \n", "\\[", "\n"]}
{"id": "math-14", "text": "Let's solve it step-by-step.  \n\n**Step 1: Understand the fuel consumption rate**  \nThe car uses **8 liters per 100 km**.\n\n**Step 2: Find how many 100 km segments are in 350 km**  \n\\[\n\\frac{350}{100} = 3.5\n\\]\n\n**Step 3: Multiply by fuel used per 100 km**  \n\\[\n3.5 \\times 8 = 28\n\\]\n\n**Step 4: Conclusion**  \nThe car needs **28 liters** of fuel for a 350 km trip.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{28}\n\\]", "tokens": ["Let", "'s", " solve", " it", " step", "-by", "-step", ".", "  \n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "1", ":", " Understand", " the", " fuel", " consumption", " rate", "**", "  \n", "The", " car", " uses", " **", "8", " liters", " per", " ", "100", " km", "**.\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "2", ":", " Find", " how", " many", " ", "100", " km", " segments", " are", " in", " ", "350", " km", "**", "  \n", "\\[", "\n", "\\frac", "{", "350", "}{", "100", "}", " =", " ", "3", ".", "5", "\n", "\\]\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "3", ":", " Multiply", " by", " fuel", " used", " per", " ", "100", " km", "**", "  \n", "\\[", "\n", "3", ".", "5", " \\", "times", " ", "8", " =", " ", "28", "\n", "\\]\n\n", "**", "Step", " ", "4", ":", " Conclusion", "**", "  \n", "The", " car", " needs", " **", "28", " liters", "**", " of", " fuel", " for", " a", " ", "350", " km", " trip", ".\n\n", "\\[", "\n", "\\", "box", "ed", "{", "28", "}\n", "\\]"]}
